# Normalize line endings to LF for every text file, regardless of the
# platform or a contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows
# checkouts convert everything to CRLF and the Prettier pre-commit hook
# fails repo-wide on line endings alone, not real content.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending-normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.webm binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.pdf binary
